        <div class="pd-best-for"><strong>Best For:</strong> Front yards, side yards, low-traffic landscaping accents</div>
        <div class="pd-btns">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
          <a href="/media/az_turf_suppliers_natural_blend_75_spec_sheet.pdf" target="_blank" class="btn btn-dark">Download Spec Sheet <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg></a>
        </div>

