          </div>
          <div class="pd-key-spec">
            <span class="pd-key-label">Pile Height</span>
            <span class="pd-key-value">1.5"</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-key-spec">
            <span class="pd-key-label">Color</span>
            <span class="pd-key-value">Yellow/Green</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-key-spec">
            <span class="pd-key-label">Roll Width</span>
            <span class="pd-key-value">15'</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pd-features" data-reveal>
          <h3>Features</h3>
          <div class="pd-feature">
            <div class="pd-feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"/><line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"/><line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"/><line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/><line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"/></svg></div>
            <p><strong>CoolYarn Technology</strong> — Yarn shape improves airflow, helping heat escape more efficiently and keeping surface temperatures lower.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-feature">
            <div class="pd-feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div>
            <p><strong>Enhanced Durability</strong> — Engineered yarn structure enhances fiber strength, making the material both stronger and more durable.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pd-feature">
            <div class="pd-feature-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></div>
            <p><strong>UV-Stabilized</strong> — Resists fading, helping maintain color and appearance even with prolonged sun exposure.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pd-badges">
          <span class="pd-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Lead-Free</span>
          <span class="pd-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Pet-Friendly</span>
          <span class="pd-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> 15-Year Warranty</span>
          <span class="pd-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> CoolYarn</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ FULL SPECIFICATIONS ═══ -->
